{"3994440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Legend of the Valkyrie - ᛁᚢᛊᛟᛏᛜᚾᛞᛊᛏᛋ", "steam_appid": 3994440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Born of the Norns’ myths, our journey begins. We awaken in Midgard, torn from a dream in which we fall from Asgard. Through the roots and branches of Yggdrasil, our fate unfolds – every deed and every decision shaping the course of the world and inevitably leading to one of two endings: to defy Ragnarök or to bring about the end of all things. Along this path we wield swords, axes, and bows of immense power. Arrows, potions, and supplies determine victory or defeat. Odin’s companions emerge from the shadows, enchanted springs unleash new strength, and mighty bosses put our courage to the ultimate test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Off the path lie hidden treasures and ancient riddles – secrets that whisper of worlds long forgotten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed exclusively for VR, the game delivers precise hit detection, realistic physics, and the full-bodied presence of creatures. Weapons are not only tools of attack, but can also move objects, deflect strikes, or even block arrows in flight – turning every encounter into an intense, tangible experience. Soar with Huginn, ride Sleipnir, and fight alongside Freki.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ragnarök – often mistaken for the “Twilight of the Gods.” In truth, it means “the fate of the gods”; not merely an end, but the inevitable course of cosmic destiny, as told in the myths.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Born of the Norns’ myths, our journey begins. We awaken in Midgard, torn from a dream in which we fall from Asgard. Through the roots and branches of Yggdrasil, our fate unfolds – every deed and every decision shaping the course of the world and inevitably leading to one of two endings: to defy Ragnarök or to bring about the end of all things. Along this path we wield swords, axes, and bows of immense power. Arrows, potions, and supplies determine victory or defeat. Odin’s companions emerge from the shadows, enchanted springs unleash new strength, and mighty bosses put our courage to the ultimate test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Off the path lie hidden treasures and ancient riddles – secrets that whisper of worlds long forgotten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed exclusively for VR, the game delivers precise hit detection, realistic physics, and the full-bodied presence of creatures. Weapons are not only tools of attack, but can also move objects, deflect strikes, or even block arrows in flight – turning every encounter into an intense, tangible experience. Soar with Huginn, ride Sleipnir, and fight alongside Freki.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ragnarök – often mistaken for the “Twilight of the Gods.” In truth, it means “the fate of the gods”; not merely an end, but the inevitable course of cosmic destiny, as told in the myths.</p>", "short_description": "Journey through Yggdrasil in VR: Discover weapons and mystical sources of power, aid allies and face your trials. Two possible endings await, beginning in Helheim. Soar with Huginn, ride Sleipnir, and fight alongside Freki.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994440/b73f889bf318b49069dec6fb020786d6ed202406/header.jpg?t=1764145570", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994440/8cf315887e27ad0979264a56e6f63b17ab7d65e2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764145570", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994440/8cf315887e27ad0979264a56e6f63b17ab7d65e2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=176414557